  "prefLabel": "Jus 1404.01 Recordkeeping",
  "priorExpiration": "2019-04-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1404.01 Recordkeeping. Every declarant shall keep a copy of each document and all written information submitted to the bureau in connection with any notice or application for exemption ultimately granted until January 31 of the calendar year following the year in which all units in the condominium shall have been sold or disposed of by the declarant.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Jus 1400) #9783-A, eff 9-11-10, EXPIRED: 9-11-18\n\nNew. #12657, INTERIM, eff 11-1-18, EXPIRED: 4-30-19\n\nNew. #12910, eff 10-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus1400.html"
